    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 6px 0 26px 4px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #1f1f1f;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #f2d9a0;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  p.text {\n    font-size: 18.5px;\n    line-height: 2.05;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background: #fbe6b0;\n  }\n  .hl-orange {\n    background: #f8dcc4;\n  }\n  /* side notes */\n  .note {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .note-1 { margin-top: 22px; }\n  .note-2 { margin-top: 150px; }\n  .note-3 { margin-top: 100px; }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #ddd7cb;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    padding: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"moon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <div class=\"page-num\">31</div>\n      <div class=\"keywords\">Keywords:</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dots\">○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○</div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      Date:<br>\n      From:<br>\n      Time:\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"main-col\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">适用主题一:走出信息茧房</h1>\n      <p class=\"text\">\n        皆言“<span class=\"hl-yellow\">身体和灵魂总有一个在路上</span>”，从一泻千里、万里直下的长江，到漫漫黄沙中莫高窟的千年悲叹，一本《<span class=\"hl-yellow\">文化苦旅</span>》，是对文化的一场朝圣，也是对生命终极意义的一次追问与探寻。翻开扉页，厚重的文化气息扑面而来，“<span class=\"hl-yellow\">方知其于漫漫岁月间，浪迹宇内，周济天下，一路伤痕斑斑，而身心犹健</span>”。当<span class=\"hl-orange\">短平快的社交网络吞噬人类最后的精神小屋之时，不妨回归山河之间，让浮躁的灵魂被山川重新注入几分清冽，看文明与历史的火种绵延千载，岁月不枉</span>。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-col\">\n      <div class=\"note note-1\">出自电影《罗马假日》</div>\n      <div class=\"note note-2\">来自余秋雨《文化苦旅》自题的序言</div>\n      <div class=\"note note-3\">与其在信息茧房中成为与世隔绝的孤立者,不妨走出舒适区,追寻精神上的远方,寻找远方的自己</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">[illegible]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
